---
title: "Bankrate Developer Portal"
description: "Integrate trusted financial rate data into your applications. Access real-time mortgage rates, savings yields, and credit card offers through our API platform."
---

::page-section
---
tag: "section"
full-width: false
max-width: "1312px"
margin: "0"
padding: "clamp(24px, 3vw, 24px) var(--kui-space-70) 0"
background-color: "var(--gray-50)"
---
  ::container
  ---
  max-width: "1312px"
  margin: "0 auto"
  padding: "0"
  ---
    ::page-hero
    ---
    full-width: true
    max-width: "1312px"
    background-color: "var(--kui-color-background-inverse)"
    border-radius: "56px"
    background-image:
      url: "https://github.com/GCROWDERR/kong-portal-saves/raw/main/images/background-swoosh.svg"
      background-position: "center"
      background-repeat: "no-repeat"
      background-size: "cover"
    padding: "clamp(48px, 5vw, 80px) clamp(24px, 4vw, 64px)"
    text-align: "center"
    text-max-width: "720px"
    title-tag: "h1"
    title-font-size: "clamp(36px, 4vw, 48px)"
    title-line-height: "1.2"
    title-font-weight: "600"
    title-color: "#ffffff"
    description-font-size: "18px"
    description-line-height: "1.4"
    description-color: "var(--kui-color-text-neutral-weaker)"
    color: "#ffffff"
    styles: |
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
      margin-inline: auto;
      & h1 {
        font-family: var(--kui-font-family-heading), ui-serif, Georgia, serif;
      }
      & > * {
        position: relative;
        z-index: 1;
      }
    ---
    #tagline
    <span style="display:block;margin:0 auto var(--kui-space-40);font-size:14px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.7;letter-spacing:2.5px;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--kui-color-text-primary-weak, #7bacff);">Real-Time Financial Rates</span>

    #title
    Bankrate Developer Portal

    #description
    Integrate trusted financial rate data into your applications. Access real-time mortgage rates, savings yields, credit card offers, and calculation tools through our robust API platform.

    #actions
      :::button
      ---
      appearance: "primary"
      size: "large"
      to: "/guides"
      ---
      Get Started →
      :::

      :::button
      ---
      appearance: "secondary"
      size: "large"
      to: "/apis"
      color: "#ffffff"
      border: "2px solid #ffffff"
      background-color: "transparent"
      ---
      Browse APIs
      :::
    ::
  ::

  ::container
  ---
  padding: "var(--kui-space-90) 0 0"
  max-width: "1312px"
  margin: "0 auto"
  ---
    ::multi-column
    ---
    columns-breakpoints:
      mobile: 1
      tablet: 2
      desktop: 2
    gap: "20px"
    ---
      :::snippet
      ---
      name: "bankrate-link-tile"
      data:
        linkHref: "/guides"
        imageSrc: "https://bankrate-static.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/devportal/book-scribble.svg"
        cardTitle: "Read the Guides"
        cardBody: "Browse integration guides, partner specs, and technical references."
      ---
      :::

      :::snippet
      ---
      name: "bankrate-link-tile"
      data:
        linkHref: "/apis"
        imageSrc: "https://bankrate-static.s3.us-east-1.amazonaws.com/devportal/code-scribble.svg"
        cardTitle: "Explore APIs"
        cardBody: "Browse our full catalog of financial data APIs with interactive endpoint docs."
      ---
      :::
    ::
  ::

  ::container
  ---
  padding: "var(--kui-space-90) 0 var(--kui-space-90)"
  max-width: "1312px"
  margin: "0 auto"
  ---
    ::page-hero
    ---
    full-width: true
    max-width: "100%"
    width: "100%"
    title-tag: "h2"
    text-align: "center"
    title-font-size: "36px"
    title-line-height: "40px"
    description-font-weight: "400"
    description-font-size: "22px"
    description-line-height: "30px"
    background-color: "var(--kui-color-background-primary-weakest)"
    border-radius: "48px"
    padding: "20px 0px"
    box-sizing: "border-box"
    ---
    #title
    API Products

    #description
    Explore our suite of financial data APIs.

    #actions
      :::button
      ---
      appearance: "primary"
      size: "large"
      to: "/apis"
      ---
      View APIs
      :::
    ::
  ::

::
